# --- Streamlit / app runtime artifacts ---
src/app/dax_data.csv

# --- Raw / intermediate preprocessing outputs ---
# All of src/preprocessing/*.py's raw/intermediate output (GDELT zip dumps,
# extracted headline leads, fetched price data, and the pipeline run
# manifest) lives under data/raw/ — see README and pipeline_config.py.
# Not shipped in the repo; regenerate locally by running the pipeline.
#
# Note: preprocess.py (stage 5) writes its FINAL output directly into
# data/dax_final_with_sentiment_*.parquet — the same files shipped in this
# repo — so re-running the pipeline will show those as modified in `git
# status` rather than as new untracked files. That's intentional: it's how
# you'd update the shipped dataset to a new date range.
data/raw/

